Context
    DocumentVersion: 0.11.1-draft
    GrammarVersion: 1.0.1
    Language: en

Module
    Type: Module
    Role: Content
    AbstractionLevel: High
    Caption: Sum a ledger and split it with a loud zero guard

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: main
        Returns: share

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Ledger entries
            Op: Core.List
            Params: 10, 20, 30
            Returns: items

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Running total starts at zero
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: acc

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Scan position starts at zero
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: i

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Length bounds the accumulation
            Op: Core.ListLen
            Params: items
            Returns: n

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Enter while position is inside
            Op: Core.Lt
            Params: i, n
            Returns: cont

        Loop
            Type: Loop
            Role: Content
            Caption: Bounded accumulation over the ledger
            Condition: cont

            Body
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Read the current entry
                    Op: Core.ListGet
                    Params: items, i
                    Returns: v

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Add it to the total
                    Op: Core.Add
                    Params: acc, v
                    Returns: acc

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Advance the position
                    Op: Core.Add
                    Params: i, 1
                    Returns: i

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Re-evaluate the bound
                    Op: Core.Lt
                    Params: i, n
                    Returns: cont

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Tag of a boolean value
            Op: Core.TypeOf
            Params: true
            Returns: t1

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Tag of an integer value
            Op: Core.TypeOf
            Params: 1
            Returns: t2

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Tags differ so bool is never an int
            Op: Core.Eq
            Params: t1, t2
            Returns: strict

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Split the total in two parts
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 2
            Returns: divisor

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: A zero divisor must never reach Div
            Op: Core.Eq
            Params: divisor, 0
            Returns: isZero

        Branch
            Type: Branch
            Role: Content
            Caption: Loud fallback instead of a hidden trap
            Condition: isZero

            TrueBlock
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Degenerate split is zero
                    Op: Core.Lit
                    Params: 0
                    Returns: share

            FalseBlock
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Even split of the ledger total
                    Op: Core.Div
                    Params: acc, divisor
                    Returns: share

        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            Caption: One share of the total
            State: Ok
            Returns: share
